# Refuse to install under a Node this tree's dependencies declare themselves
# incompatible with, instead of installing anyway and failing later somewhere
# unrelated-looking. That is not hypothetical: jsdom 30 requires Node >= 22.22.2,
# and on Node 20 `npm ci` succeeded, then the single jsdom-environment test died
# with `webidl.util.markAsUncloneable is not a function` from deep inside undici.
#
# `engines` in package.json states the requirement; this makes npm enforce it,
# for this package and for every dependency it installs.
engine-strict=true
